  "reasoning": "The defendant, as a business employee, abused his position to issue false delivery orders, used the company seal without authorization, and removed company goods to sell them for personal benefit. This constitutes misappropriation of company assets using his job convenience, which aligns with the crime of misappropriating (embezzling) company funds or property, termed 挪用资金 in Chinese criminal law.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]挪用资金<eoa>"
}
